          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Gently hold the bob, move it slightly to one side and release it. Take care not to push the bob while releasing it and that the string is taut. Is your pendulum now oscillating?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.144,
            0.882,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Using a watch, "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "measure",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the time it takes for the pendulum to complete 10 oscillations. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Record",
              "styles": [
