            0.526
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is the time period of your pendulum almost the same every time? What do you "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "conclude",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " from this observation? The time period of the pendulum is almost the same every time."
